{
  "title": "Concat",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "What it is",
      "lines": [
        "A corpus concat-",
        "enative synth.",
        "Point it at a",
        "folder of audio.",
        "It slices, describes",
        "every slice, and",
        "plays grains from",
        "wherever you are in",
        "that timbre space.",
        "",
        "Or feed live input",
        "and it mosaics it",
        "through your corpus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "First sound",
      "lines": [
        "1. Dive into Corpus",
        "   from the root",
        "   menu.",
        "2. Select Source",
        "   and pick any",
        "   sample or a",
        "   .concat corpus.",
        "3. Wait: Analyze",
        "   counts to 100%.",
        "   Slow first time,",
        "   cached after.",
        "4. Back to root.",
        "   Hit the pads."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Root page",
      "lines": [
        "The 8 knobs on the",
        "root are for live",
        "play:",
        "",
        "K1 X Pos",
        "K2 Y Pos",
        "K3 Density",
        "K4 Grain Size",
        "K5 Amp Atk",
        "K6 Amp Rel",
        "K7 Polyphony",
        "K8 Filter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Play modes",
      "lines": [
        "Play page > Play",
        "Mode:",
        "",
        "Notes (default):",
        " each pad is a",
        " polyphonic voice.",
        "",
        "Map: X/Y knobs +",
        " LFO travel the",
        " timbre map. Hold",
        " a pad to jump to",
        " a timbre cluster.",
        "",
        "Mosaic: line/mic",
        " in gets re-voiced",
        " through the corpus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Note Match",
      "lines": [
        "Play page > Note",
        "(Notes mode only):",
        "",
        "Zone (default):",
        " each pad plays a",
        " different part of",
        " the corpus, at",
        " natural pitch.",
        "",
        "Pitch: nearest-",
        " pitched slice,",
        " retuned to note.",
        "",
        "Off: current map",
        " point, retuned."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Scope",
      "lines": [
        "Mod & Set > Scope:",
        "",
        "File (default):",
        " the picked sample",
        " is the whole",
        " corpus, onset-",
        " sliced into many",
        " pieces.",
        "",
        "Folder: the picked",
        " file's folder",
        " (and subfolders)",
        " is the corpus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Corpus files",
      "lines": [
        "A .concat file is a",
        "corpus built from",
        "many folders and",
        "samples, trimmed,",
        "with chosen",
        "descriptors.",
        "",
        "Make them in the",
        "Corpus Builder web",
        "page (Schwung",
        "manager, Remote UI,",
        "Concat's track).",
        "",
        "Pick one in Source.",
        "Edits reload while",
        "the old corpus",
        "keeps playing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Map + Mod & Set",
      "lines": [
        "Map page:",
        " X/Y Desc pick the",
        " axes. Map Mode:",
        " Raw (X/Y = your",
        " descriptors) or",
        " Learned (PCA plane",
        " of the corpus).",
        "",
        "Mod & Set page:",
        " Follow = LFO or",
        " Sequence. Sequence",
        " locks LFO Rate to",
        " the MIDI clock",
        " (cycles per beat)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Filter",
      "lines": [
        "Out or root > K8",
        "Filter: bipolar.",
        "",
        "Center 0.5:",
        " bypass.",
        "Left 0 to 0.5:",
        " LP sweeping down",
        " (dark).",
        "Right 0.5 to 1:",
        " HP sweeping up",
        " (thin)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pressure",
      "lines": [
        "Play page > Pressure",
        "picks what pad",
        "pressure modulates:",
        "",
        "Proximity, Density,",
        "Bright, Sat, Pitch,",
        "Grain, Jitter.",
        "",
        "Press Amt sets",
        "depth. Vel Amount",
        "sets how much pad",
        "velocity scales",
        "volume."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Deploy notes",
      "lines": [
        "Any module update",
        "needs a power-cycle:",
        "Schwung caches the",
        "manifest at startup.",
        "",
        "Save your set first:",
        "a restart resets",
        "unsaved knobs."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
